rk's crypto asset. The rewards rates, expressed as an annual percentage yield, vary by asset. In return for the services we provide, we earn a fixed percentage commission on all staking rewards received.","zh":null}],"competition":[{"en":"The crypto industry is highly innovative, rapidly evolving, and characterized by healthy competition, experimentation, changing customer needs, frequent introductions of new products and services, and is subject to uncertain and evolving industry and regulatory requirements. We face significant competition from a variety of companies around the world—ranging from crypto-native companies, including decentralized exchanges, to large traditional financial services incumbents and financial technology providers.","zh":null},{"en":"traditional financial services and financial technology companies. This includes companies that offer crypto powered products, as well as companies that only offer traditional products, such as stocks. With the expansion in our product offerings in 2025 to include stocks, prediction markets and more, our competitive set in this category has broadened;","zh":null}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Bank Servicing & Subscription & Circulation","val":6883438000,"zh":"Bank Servicing & Subscription & Circulation"},{"name":"Bank Servicing","val":4055390000,"zh":"Bank Servicing"},{"name":"Bank Servicing Consumer Net","val":3322835000,"zh":"Bank Servicing Consumer Net"},{"name":"Subscription & Circulation","val":2828048000,"zh":"Subscription & Circulation"},{"name":"Subscription & Circulation Stablecoin","val":1348821000,"zh":"Subscription & Circulation Stablecoin"},{"name":"Subscription & Circulation Blockchain Infrastructure Service","val":677405000,"zh":"Subscription & Circulation Blockchain Infrastructure Service"},{"name":"Subscription & Circulation Other","val":554775000,"zh":"Subscription & Circulation Other"},{"name":"Bank Servicing Institutional","val":479667000,"zh":"Bank Servicing Institutional"},{"name":"Other Revenue","val":297887000,"zh":"Other Revenue"},{"name":"Bank Servicing Other","val":252888000,"zh":"Bank Servicing Other"}],"total":7181325000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":6010607000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":1170718000,"zh":"Non Us"}],"total":7181325000}},"peers":["HOOD","MSTR","PLTR","RBLX","SOFI"]}}